---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy - Banners All Over" description="Cookie Policy for Banners All Over - How we use cookies and tracking technologies">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL} class="nav-link inline-flex items-center text-bao-blue hover:text-bao-blue-600 transition-colors mb-6">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Home
      </a>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600">Last Updated: December 9, 2025</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="legal-content prose prose-lg max-w-none">

      <!-- Current Status -->
      <div class="mb-8 p-6 bg-green-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-lg">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-2">Current Cookie Status: Cookie-Free</h2>
        <p class="text-green-800">
          <strong>Good News!</strong> The Banners All Over website currently does NOT use any cookies or tracking technologies. Your visit to our website is private and no cookies are stored on your device.
        </p>
        <p class="text-green-800 mt-2">
          This policy explains what cookies are and how we may use them in the future if we implement analytics or other features that require cookies.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Introduction -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">1. What Are Cookies?</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Cookies are small text files that are placed on your computer or mobile device when you visit a website. They are widely used to make websites work more efficiently and provide information to website owners.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">1.1 Types of Cookies by Duration</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Session Cookies:</strong> Temporary cookies that expire when you close your browser</li>
          <li><strong>Persistent Cookies:</strong> Cookies that remain on your device for a set period or until you delete them</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">1.2 Types of Cookies by Origin</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>First-Party Cookies:</strong> Set by the website you're visiting (Banners All Over)</li>
          <li><strong>Third-Party Cookies:</strong> Set by external services (like Google Analytics or advertising networks)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Current Usage -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">2. Our Current Cookie Usage</h2>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Marketing Website: NO COOKIES</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
            Our marketing website currently operates completely cookie-free. We do not use:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-1">
            <li>Analytics cookies (no Google Analytics or similar)</li>
            <li>Marketing or advertising cookies</li>
            <li>Social media cookies</li>
            <li>Tracking pixels or beacons</li>
            <li>Any form of cross-site tracking</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Shopify App: Shopify Session Management Only</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
            The Banners All Over Shopify app uses Shopify's authentication system, which may set strictly necessary cookies for:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-1">
            <li>User authentication and session management</li>
            <li>Security and fraud prevention</li>
            <li>App functionality</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mt-2">
            These cookies are essential for the app to function and are controlled by Shopify. For information about Shopify's cookies, please see: <a href="https://www.shopify.com/legal/cookies" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Shopify's Cookie Policy</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Future Cookie Usage -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">3. Potential Future Cookie Usage</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          If we decide to implement cookies in the future, we will update this policy and notify you. Below are examples of cookies we may use:
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">3.1 Strictly Necessary Cookies</h3>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
            <strong>Purpose:</strong> Essential for the website or app to function properly
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
            <strong>Examples:</strong>
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 text-sm space-y-1">
            <li>Authentication and session management</li>
            <li>Security and fraud detection</li>
            <li>Load balancing</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mt-2 text-sm">
            <em>Legal Basis:</em> These cookies are exempt from consent requirements under GDPR as they are strictly necessary for providing the service you requested.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">3.2 Functional Cookies</h3>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
            <strong>Purpose:</strong> Remember your preferences and personalize your experience
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
            <strong>Examples:</strong>
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 text-sm space-y-1">
            <li>Language preferences</li>
            <li>Region or timezone settings</li>
            <li>User interface preferences</li>
            <li>Whether you've dismissed notifications</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mt-2 text-sm">
            <em>Consent:</em> We would request your consent before setting these cookies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">3.3 Analytics and Performance Cookies</h3>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
            <strong>Purpose:</strong> Help us understand how visitors interact with our website
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
            <strong>Potential Services:</strong>
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 text-sm space-y-1">
            <li>Google Analytics (website traffic and behavior)</li>
            <li>Mixpanel or Amplitude (app usage analytics)</li>
            <li>Hotjar or similar (user session recordings and heatmaps)</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2 text-sm">
            <strong>Data Collected:</strong> Pages visited, time on site, bounce rate, traffic sources, anonymized user behavior
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mt-2 text-sm">
            <em>Consent:</em> We would request your consent before setting these cookies and offer opt-out options.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">3.4 Marketing and Advertising Cookies</h3>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
            <strong>Purpose:</strong> Deliver relevant advertisements and measure campaign effectiveness
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">
            <strong>Potential Services:</strong>
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 text-sm space-y-1">
            <li>Google Ads and Google Marketing Platform</li>
            <li>Facebook Pixel</li>
            <li>LinkedIn Insight Tag</li>
            <li>Retargeting and remarketing services</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2 text-sm">
            <strong>Data Collected:</strong> Pages visited, products viewed, ads clicked, conversion events
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mt-2 text-sm">
            <em>Consent:</em> We would request your explicit consent before setting these cookies.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Cookie Consent -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">4. Cookie Consent and Your Choices</h2>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">4.1 Future Cookie Consent Mechanism</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          If we implement non-essential cookies in the future, you will see a cookie consent banner when you first visit our website. The banner will allow you to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>Accept all cookies</li>
          <li>Reject non-essential cookies</li>
          <li>Customize your cookie preferences by category</li>
          <li>Access detailed information about each cookie type</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">4.2 Managing Cookie Preferences</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          When we implement cookies, you will be able to manage your preferences through:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Cookie Settings:</strong> A link in the website footer to update your preferences at any time</li>
          <li><strong>Browser Settings:</strong> Configure your browser to block or delete cookies (see Section 5)</li>
          <li><strong>Opt-Out Tools:</strong> Third-party opt-out mechanisms for analytics and advertising</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">4.3 Impact of Rejecting Cookies</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          If you reject cookies:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Strictly Necessary Cookies:</strong> Cannot be disabled as they are essential for the service to function</li>
          <li><strong>Functional Cookies:</strong> Your preferences may not be saved, and you may need to re-enter settings</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics Cookies:</strong> You can browse freely without being tracked, but we won't collect anonymized usage data</li>
          <li><strong>Marketing Cookies:</strong> You won't see personalized ads, but may still see generic advertising</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Browser Controls -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">5. Managing Cookies Through Your Browser</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings. You can:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>View what cookies are stored and delete them individually</li>
          <li>Block third-party cookies</li>
          <li>Block cookies from specific websites</li>
          <li>Block all cookies</li>
          <li>Delete all cookies when you close your browser</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">5.1 Browser-Specific Instructions</h3>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded">
            <p class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">Google Chrome</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Settings → Privacy and security → Cookies and other site data</p>
            <a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" class="text-xs text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded">
            <p class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">Mozilla Firefox</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Settings → Privacy & Security → Cookies and Site Data</p>
            <a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/enhanced-tracking-protection-firefox-desktop" class="text-xs text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded">
            <p class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">Safari (macOS)</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Preferences → Privacy → Cookies and website data</p>
            <a href="https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/manage-cookies-sfri11471/mac" class="text-xs text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded">
            <p class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">Microsoft Edge</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Settings → Cookies and site permissions → Manage and delete cookies</p>
            <a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/delete-cookies-in-microsoft-edge-63947406-40ac-c3b8-57b9-2a946a29ae09" class="text-xs text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded">
            <p class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">Safari (iOS)</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Settings → Safari → Block All Cookies</p>
            <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT201265" class="text-xs text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded">
            <p class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">Chrome (Android)</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">Settings → Site settings → Cookies</p>
            <a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647#android" class="text-xs text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4 text-sm italic">
          Note: Disabling cookies may affect the functionality of many websites, not just ours.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Third-Party Opt-Outs -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">6. Third-Party Opt-Out Tools</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          If we implement third-party analytics or advertising in the future, you can opt-out using these tools:
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">6.1 Analytics Opt-Outs</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a></li>
          <li><strong>Do Not Track (DNT):</strong> Enable DNT in your browser settings (not universally supported)</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">6.2 Advertising Opt-Outs</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Digital Advertising Alliance (DAA):</strong> <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Your Ad Choices</a></li>
          <li><strong>Network Advertising Initiative (NAI):</strong> <a href="https://optout.networkadvertising.org/" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NAI Opt-Out</a></li>
          <li><strong>European Interactive Digital Advertising Alliance:</strong> <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.com/" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Your Online Choices</a></li>
          <li><strong>Google Ads:</strong> <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ads Settings</a></li>
          <li><strong>Facebook:</strong> <a href="https://www.facebook.com/ads/preferences" class="text-bao-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ad Preferences</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Tracking Technologies -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">7. Other Tracking Technologies</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          In addition to cookies, we may use other tracking technologies in the future:
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">7.1 Web Beacons (Pixels)</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Small transparent images embedded in web pages or emails that allow us to track whether content was viewed. Used in email campaigns to measure open rates and engagement.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">7.2 Local Storage</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Browser storage mechanisms (localStorage, sessionStorage) that allow websites to store data locally. May be used for preferences or temporary data that doesn't need to be sent to the server.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">7.3 Fingerprinting</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          We do NOT use and will NOT use device fingerprinting or other covert tracking techniques.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Updates to Policy -->
      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">8. Changes to This Cookie Policy</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          We may update this Cookie Policy to reflect changes in our use of cookies or for legal or regulatory reasons.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">8.1 Before Implementing Cookies</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          If we decide to implement cookies for the first time, we will:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>Update this Cookie Policy with specific details about the cookies we use</li>
          <li>Implement a cookie consent banner on our website</li>
          <li>Provide you with clear choices about cookie preferences</li>
          <li>Update the "Last Updated" date at the top of this page</li>
          <li>Send notification to existing users (if applicable)</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">8.2 Ongoing Updates</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Any material changes to this policy will be communicated through our website and, where appropriate, via email. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact Information -->
      <section id="questions-about-cookies" class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">9. Questions About Cookies</h2>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          If you have any questions about our use of cookies or this Cookie Policy, please see the <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/legal/privacy#contact-us`} class="text-bao-blue hover:underline font-semibold">contact information in our Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700">
          For information about how we handle your data, please review our <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/legal/privacy`} class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/legal/terms`} class="text-bao-blue hover:underline">Terms of Service</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Summary -->
      <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-bao-blue rounded">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Summary: Your Privacy Matters</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
          We believe in transparency and respect for your privacy. Currently, we do not use cookies on our marketing website. If we implement cookies in the future, we will always ask for your consent (except for strictly necessary cookies), provide clear information about our use of cookies, and give you control over your preferences. You can always change your mind and update your cookie settings at any time.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose {
    color: #374151;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Enhanced link styling for legal content */
  .legal-content a:not(.nav-link):not(.card-link) {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(19, 134, 242, 0.4);
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .legal-content a:not(.nav-link):not(.card-link):hover {
    color: rgb(13, 95, 184); /* darker blue */
    text-decoration-color: rgb(13, 95, 184);
  }

  /* External link indicator */
  .legal-content a[target="_blank"]:not(.nav-link):not(.card-link)::after {
    content: "↗";
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 3px;
    font-size: 0.85em;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .prose a {
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .prose ul {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .selection-bao::selection {
    background-color: #1386F2;
    color: white;
  }
</style>
